Package: sgx-guardian-client
Version: 1.0.0
Section: security
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: CyberZeus Security <security@cyberzeus.io>
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.31), systemd, ca-certificates, nftables, nmap, libcap2-bin
Description: SGX Guardian Client - Zero-Trust Edge Security Agent
 SGX Guardian Client is a zero-trust edge security agent designed
 to operate autonomously on distributed nodes. It enforces signed
 security policies locally, establishes mutually attested mTLS
 communication with trusted peers, and maintains tamper-evident
 audit logs. The agent continues to operate securely even when
 disconnected from central infrastructure.
